// Blasts: what a burst does to bodies and structures around it. Linear
// falloff keeps `edge_fraction` of `max_damage` at the `radius`; with `core`
// above 0 it is concentrated (half damage at `core` metres). `impulse` is
// the kick, divided by the body's mass. The base turrets' plasma keeps its
// own older curve (`quadratic`): `edge_damage` x fall + `core_damage` x
// fall², `max_damage` on a direct hit, and a fixed `kick` (m/s).
